        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Sep 23, 2025",
            "id": "de122d9a-20d0-413f-85d7-55902b0cd370",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your wonderful feedback! We’re thrilled to hear that the home exceeded your expectations and that you enjoyed its proximity to the beach and the second-floor kitchen. We’re glad our team could assist and make your stay more comfortable, especially for your family member. Your kind words mean a lot, and we hope to welcome you back for another fantastic stay in the future!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The stay was awesome, and the home exceeded our expectations. The property manager was very timely in responding to any inquiries we had and even purchased a 12 Quart pot for us to assist in making dinner.The property is closer to the beach than you would think and has access to the public beaches.Overall, the pictures do not do the house justice; it is much nicer than what you see, especially the kitchen on the second floor.The house was extremely handicap friendly as we had a member who was wheelchair-bound, and the only issue was getting her up the steps into the house.Thanx to the team for giving is a great stay!",
        "themes": [
          "Liked: Cleanliness, check-in, communication, location, listing accuracy"
        ],
        "verified": true
      }
    ],
